Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; PGA TOUR Golf Championship Edition III (Global VR): the cabinet's registry. The frontend's ActiveX
; controls (C:\Orion\ShellControl.ocx and Diagnostics.ocx, their regsvr32 registration) and the
; shell's and game's settings, from the game's install CD (its _Registry, copied to the dump:
; GVRShell.reg, HKLM EaSports.reg, HKLM EA.reg, HKCU EaSports.reg, HKLM Fonts.reg, and the
; gvr.net folder's Gvr_Net.reg), with free play (the shell's Pay4Play; its cabinet configuration,
; payload gvrnet.rs, has free play too) and the installation's settings done (IntlSettingUpdate 0:
; else the shell resets the cabinet configuration to its factory settings, pay to play, at each
; start). Imported at each launch.
